            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">READING CLUB</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Chapters 13 and 14</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1. Was the socialist left large or small?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"290\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2. One reform: real gain or co-optation?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"420\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3. Lawrence won, Ludlow bled: why?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"550\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">4. War and dissent: a general rule?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"680\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">5. Can we judge Debs fairly from Zinn?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"840\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Next week: Chapters 15 and 16</text></svg>",
