            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">READING CLUB</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Chapters 19-20 discussion</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"287\" width=\"920\" height=\"106\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">1. THE BIGGEST SURPRISE</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"417\" width=\"920\" height=\"106\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.13)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">2. WHO COUNTS AS \"THE PEOPLE\"?</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"547\" width=\"920\" height=\"106\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">3. ATTICA AND CREDIBILITY</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"677\" width=\"920\" height=\"106\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.13)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">4. DID THE SYSTEM WORK?</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"807\" width=\"920\" height=\"106\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">5. EXCESS OF DEMOCRACY</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Five questions for this week's chapters"
