            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Chapters 21-22</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"450\" width=\"920\" height=\"138\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.13)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"498\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"536\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">How does the 1986 veto override test Zinn's thesis?</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"612\" width=\"920\" height=\"138\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.13)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">HINT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"698\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Who controlled the Senate, and who was president?</text></svg>",
