            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">AFTER SEPTEMBER 11</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Zinn's chain of argument</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.2)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Attacks:</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">a crime</text><path d=\"M280 270 L340 270\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"340,270 328,262 328,278\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"200\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.2)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Response:</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">a war</text><path d=\"M560 270 L620 270\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"620,270 608,262 608,278\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"620\" y=\"200\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.2)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Civilians</text><text x=\"730\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">killed</text><path d=\"M840 270 L900 270\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"900,270 888,262 888,278\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"900\" y=\"200\" width=\"160\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.2)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"980\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">New</text><text x=\"980\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">anger</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"420\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ZINN'S ALTERNATIVE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ask why -- pursue terrorists as criminals</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"640\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">AT HOME</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">PATRIOT Act: liberties at risk</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Zinn treats the September 11 attacks as a crime and argues that answering them with war feeds a cycle of violence."
